,"kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:p020","text":"皋陶作士以理民。帝舜朝，禹、伯夷、皋陶相與語帝前。皋陶述其謀曰：「信其道德，謀明輔和。」禹曰：「然，如何？」皋陶曰：「於！慎其身脩，思長，敦序九族，衆明高翼，近可遠在已。」禹拜美言，曰：「然。」皋陶曰：「於！在知人，在安民。」禹曰：「吁！皆若是，惟帝其難之。知人則智，能官人；能安民則惠，黎民懷之。能知能惠，何憂乎驩兜，何遷乎有苗，何畏乎巧言善色佞人？」皋陶曰：「然，於！亦行有九德，亦言其有德。」乃言曰：「始事事，寬而栗，柔而立，愿而共，治而敬，擾而毅，直而溫，簡而廉，剛而實，彊而義，章其有常，吉哉。日宣三德，蚤夜翊明有家。日嚴振敬六德，亮采有國。翕受普施，九德咸事，俊乂在官，百吏肅謹。毋教邪淫奇謀。非其人居其官，是謂亂天事。天討有辠，五刑五用哉。吾言厎可行乎？」禹曰：「女言致可績行。」皋陶曰：「余未有知，思贊道哉。」","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"帝舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"伯夷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000047","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段與前後段的帝舜及對話敘事暫定為舜，非全篇所有「帝」的自動對應。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m020-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"禹","kind":"p